  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "BAU Global is an international education network anchored on Bahçeşehir University, whose main campus is in Beşiktaş, Istanbul, Turkey. Founded in 1998, Bahçeşehir University offers nearly 200 undergraduate, graduate, and doctoral programs across architecture, art, business administration, communication, design, economics, education, engineering, health sciences, information technologies, law, medicine, and social sciences. The BAU Global network includes universities in Istanbul, Washington D.C., Berlin, Cyprus, and Batumi (Georgia), along with language schools and liaison offices across Europe, the Americas, and Asia."
    ]
  },
